# The archive is not prettier's to format.
#
# Two concrete reasons, both verified rather than theoretical:
#
#   1. It BREAKS THE BUILD. Prettier's markdown printer rewrites an MDX comment
#      `{/* … */}` into `{/_ … _/}`, which the MDX compiler then refuses to
#      parse. Every post scaffolded by `npm run new:post` contains such a
#      comment, so `npm run format` would arm this in every new essay.
#
#   2. The manifests already have a canonical formatter. scripts/lib/manifest.mjs
#      writes deterministic, fixed-key-order YAML with the width lists inline.
#      Reformatting them here would churn the archive's git history and fight
#      the importer on every run.
#
# And more generally: this is prose. Nothing should reflow Dali's paragraphs.
